Wayland local copies are readable before the compositor echoes ownership. Authoritative replacements and
matching source cancellations revoke that shortcut. Reads are withheld while keyboard-unfocused without
losing offers between this client's surfaces. Per-process-instance, per-selection and per-copy opaque MIME
markers let a clipboard manager return the last private rich snapshot only after its real text matches.
No rich metadata or mention identifiers are advertised; retired sources cannot serve the retained snapshot.

